 alongside `AZURE_CLIENT_ID` in every pod that needs workload identity.
 
+You can also build a complete workload identity credential secret directly from the identity using
+`operatorSpec.secretExpressions`. The `aso.parseResourceId` CEL function can derive the subscription ID from the
+identity's ARM resource ID, alongside the `tenantId` and `clientId` from its status:
+
+```yaml
+operatorSpec:
+  secretExpressions:
+    - name: identity-details
+      key: AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID
+      value: aso.parseResourceId(self.status.id).subscriptionId
+    - name: identity-details
+      key: AZURE_TENANT_ID
+      value: self.status.tenantId
+    - name: identity-details
+      key: AZURE_CLIENT_ID
+      value: self.status.clientId
+    - name: identity-details
+      key: USE_WORKLOAD_IDENTITY_AUTH
+      value: string(true)
+```
